        "Content": "Leonard Wislon Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you \r\n\r\n1 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom, Parking \r\nElevated South Facing Balcony \r\nRecently updated \r\nRichard Todd and LWK Group are delighted to present Apartment 53, The Horizon Building, Royal Canal Park, Ashtown, Dublin 15, to the market.\r\n\r\n Ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development, this impressive one-bedroom apartment offers bright and spacious accommodation, modern finishes and the added benefit of secure underground parking. Recently updated throughout, the property is presented in excellent condition and would make an ideal home for a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor.\r\n\r\nOn arrival at The Horizon Building, you are greeted by a modern and well-maintained development with attractive communal areas and secure access. Residents also enjoy the excellent benefit of two on-site gyms, both open seven days a week from 6am until 10pm, providing exceptional convenience for those looking to maintain an active lifestyle without having to leave the development.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the apartment, you are welcomed by a bright and airy hallway which provides access to the accommodation. To the left is the family bathroom, which is finished with quality sanitary ware and provides a clean and contemporary space. To the right is the impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, which forms the heart of the apartment and provides a wonderful space for both relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe living area has recently been upgraded and features beautiful new herringbone flooring, creating a stylish and contemporary finish. The recently upgraded kitchen offers an abundance of fitted storage, with generous base and eye-level units providing excellent practical storage and workspace. The open-plan design allows the kitchen to flow seamlessly into the dining and living areas, making the space feel both bright and spacious.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the apartment is the large floor-to-ceiling windows within the living area, which flood the room with natural light throughout the day. These windows also provide direct access to the private balcony, creating a pleasant extension of the living space and an ideal area to enjoy some fresh air or unwind.\r\n\r\nThe double bedroom is generously proportioned and benefits from excellent built-in wardrobe storage, making it both comfortable and practical. The bedroom is well positioned away from the main living space, providing a peaceful and private retreat.\r\n\r\nThe property is further enhanced by a secure underground parking space, a particularly valuable feature for city living, while residents also benefit from the well-maintained communal areas and excellent facilities within Royal Canal Park.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, with Royal Canal Park offering an excellent balance between convenient city living and a range of local amenities. There are a number of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services within easy reach, while nearby Rathborne Village provides further shopping and dining options. The Royal Canal itself is close by and offers attractive walking and cycling routes, while the extensive grounds of Phoenix Park and Tolka Valley Park are also within easy reach, providing excellent recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nTransport connections are another major advantage of the location. Pelletstown Train Station is within easy walking distance and provides regular services towards Dublin city centre and the wider commuter network, while Ashtown Station is also nearby. There are several bus routes serving the area, including the 120, providing convenient access towards the city centre. Broombridge is also accessible, offering both Luas and rail connections. For motorists, the property is ideally positioned for access to the M3 and M50, providing convenient connections to Dublin Airport, Blanchardstown and destinations throughout Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe area is also well served by a range of schools and childcare facilities, with Pelletstown Educate Together National School and a number of other primary and secondary schools located within the surrounding area.\r\n\r\nOverall, Apartment 53 represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a stylish and recently updated one-bedroom apartment in a highly desirable Dublin 15 location. With its bright open-plan living space, upgraded kitchen, new herringbone flooring, floor-to-ceiling windows, private balcony, generous double bedroom, underground parking and excellent resident facilities, this property offers modern and convenient living within easy reach of Dublin city centre.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
